OL,3,GNEWSAPolice car left wedged over sea
OL,4,Aafter pier crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police car has ploughed through the
OL,7,Frailings of a pier on the Isle of
OL,8,FWight.
OL,10,FThe Hampshire & Isle of Wight
OL,11,FConstabulary car went through the
OL,12,Frailings on Ryde Pier shortly before
OL,13,F10:10 BST and has been left wedged in
OL,14,Fplace.
OL,16,FThe force said the police car had
OL,17,Fcrashed with another vehicle and had
OL,18,Fbeen responding to an incident at the
OL,19,Ftime. It said no one had been injured.
OL,20,FThe fire service said two people who
OL,21,Fwere trapped in the car were rescued by
OL,22,Ffirefighters.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
